# Cursor Rule: 90% Unit Test Code Coverage Enforcement

- Maintain >= 90% unit test code coverage file-wise across:
  - Statements
  - Branches
  - Functions
  - Lines
- Every single application file must be covered without skipping.
- Run `npm run test:coverage` to validate before finishing any modification.
